  <section id="about">
    <div class="intro">
      <h2 class="section-title">What is ProcessApostle?</h2>

      <p>
        Government processes can sometimes be difficult to understand.
        ProcessApostle seeks to make these processes more accessible
        through educational videos, practical explanations and
        citizen-friendly information.

        Our purpose is to help people become better informed about
        their rights, responsibilities and available remedies.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="topics">
    <div class="intro">
      <h2 class="section-title">Explore Our Topics</h2>

      <p>Understanding the process is the beginning of finding a way forward.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="topics">
      <div class="topic">
        <h3>Land Transactions</h3>
        <p>Understanding land acquisition, transfers, documentation
        and the processes involved.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="topic">
        <h3>Compliance and Clearances</h3>
        <p>A practical look at documentary requirements,
        government offices and regulatory procedures.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="topic">
        <h3>Agrarian Reform</h3>
        <p>Understanding land coverage, distribution, CLOAs,
        agricultural tenancy and related concerns.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="topic">
        <h3>Land Disputes</h3>
        <p>Exploring dispute resolution, mediation,
        legal remedies and administrative processes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
